      "description": "Deploy the completed and SIT-validated 8 Storefronts Setup configuration to the UAT environment and perform QA validation of the storefront UI, ensuring all 8 regional storefronts render correctly before Zimmermann's UAT testing begins.\nTasks\nConfirm UAT environment is ready and accessible (SFCC-254 complete)\nDeploy 8 Storefronts Setup build/configuration to the UAT MRT environment\nPerform a smoke test to verify all 8 storefronts are accessible in UAT\nNotify QA/BA Lead that the feature is available for UAT testing\nQA UI Validation\nVerify each of the 8 storefront URLs loads correctly in the SIT environment\nConfirm the homepage renders without layout errors or broken elements for each storefront\nValidate that the correct currency is displayed per storefront (e.g. AUD for AU, USD for US, GBP for UK)\nValidate that the correct locale/language is applied per storefront\nConfirm storefront navigation (header, footer, menu) renders correctly across all 8 storefronts\nCheck for any console errors or broken UI components on initial page load\nLog any UI defects found and communicate to the developer before UAT handover\nAcceptance Criteria\nGiven the SIT-validated configuration, when deployed to UAT, then all 8 storefronts are accessible and functioning in the UAT environment\nGiven the deployment, when a smoke test is run, then no critical errors are present\nGiven each storefront UI, when reviewed by QA, then the correct currency, locale, and language are displayed per region with no broken layout or console errors\nGiven the completed QA UI validation, when the BA Lead is notified, then all 8 storefronts are confirmed ready for Zimmermann UAT testing\nDependencies\nSFCC-254 (UAT Deployment Setup) must be completed before this task begins",
