  "key": "SFCC-254",
  "summary": "Environment Setup - DEV, TEST, SIT & UAT for All Storefronts",
  "description": "**As an** Engineer,\n\n**I want** to configure and validate the deployment pipeline across DEV, TEST, SIT, and UAT environments for all SFCC storefronts,\n\n**so that** the team has a repeatable, documented process for deploying storefront builds to each environment in preparation for integration testing and client validation activities.\n\n----\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n\n-   DEV environment is configured, deployed, and accessible for all storefronts\n-   TEST environment is configured, deployed, and accessible for all storefronts\n-   SIT environment is configured, deployed, and accessible for all storefronts\n-   UAT environment is configured, deployed, and accessible for all storefronts\n-   Deployment pipeline is validated end-to-end for each environment\n-   Environment URLs and access credentials are documented and shared with the team\n-   Each environment is seeded with appropriate test data\n-   Smoke test passed on each environment post-deployment",
